						 <p><em>Unless otherwise stated, any graphics or images in my articles are made and/or taken by me.</em></p> <p>Happy April Fools Day. <a href="http://www.scp-wiki.net/breach-my-containment-baby">The tradition continues.</a> Thank you to Silber and Niles for reading this the other day. Anyway, I went ahead and did the favor of writing everyone's comments for them so that you wouldn't have to:</p> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">+&nbsp;show&nbsp;block</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">–&nbsp;hide&nbsp;block</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"> <p>I generally downvote things that only seem excusable because they're posted on a holiday. This is one of them.</p> <hr /> <p>This is nothing but a Series I sex joke, a Series I author avatar, some researcher no one's ever heard of, and a joke from chat rolled into a tale. This has no depth and there's no point. Downvote.</p> <hr /> <p>The 'adult' tag is for serious articles, not a joke tale with a fancy CSS theme. Downvote for immaturity.</p> <hr /></div> </div> </div> <p>CSS theme was written by <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/inithello" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1310208&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1501103466" alt="InitHello" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1310208)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/inithello" >InitHello</a></span> and you can read about its licensing/etc. info <a href="http://www.scp-wiki.net/forum/t-1663880/breach-my-containment-baby#post-2723547">here.</a></p> 
